# Market price cache policy
# `data/market_prices_cache/` is currently versioned historically, but local cache refreshes
# must not be part of ordinary branch / status / commit workflows.
# On active worktrees, keep those files excluded from day-to-day git management with
# `git update-index --skip-worktree` on that path set.
